      "comment": "Tough race. UP AND UNDER (7) goes on top post a key scratching after consecutive seconds in BM56 grade, including when sent out favourite here last week behind Nicoffhome. He rises in grade, but is a track winner and draws for every chance. FAM GORMAN (1) was only beaten a long neck in the same Hawk Power race and has five placings from eight previous starts around 2460m so he should be right there again. HOLLANDIA (6) has the distance record to improve, with one win and five placings from eight starts at the trip, though he has to rebound from a plain seventh here last week after a sound BM66 fifth at Bendigo. FRANK EXPRESS (2) is going well and 2460m suits now from a good gate.",
